Package: bookwork
Version: @VERSION@
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libx11-6, libxcb1, libdbus-1-3, libfontconfig1
Maintainer: Andrew McClain <andrew.c.mcclain@gmail.com>
Description: Cross-platform PDF imposition tool for booklet/signature printing
 Bookwork lays out (imposes) the pages of a PDF onto sheets for saddle-stitch
 or case-bound booklet printing: signature ordering, 2-up placement, margin
 and gutter control, crop marks, and a bound-preview to catch pagination
 mistakes before they hit paper.
 .
 This package bundles its own Python runtime and all dependencies
 (PyInstaller); it does not require a separately installed Python or Qt.
 The Depends listed above cover the base X11/D-Bus/fontconfig libraries
 the bundled Qt needs that aren't included in the bundle itself -- see
 packaging/README.md for the full transitive list this was checked
 against, if bookwork fails to launch with a "shared library not found"
 error on an unusual (e.g. minimal/headless) system.
